# base: DrKLO/Telegram @ 9b50143d8896d255d03155598937e4f3e28afd86 (12.8.1)
# apply: git checkout that base, then: git apply android-adblock.patch
# model: NOT in this patch (binary). CI copies assets/tgadblock/{rubert.onnx,rubert_vocab.txt}
#        into TMessagesProj/src/main/assets/tgadblock/ before building. ONNX Runtime from Maven.
#   rubert.onnx       sha256 c846bfd6d3d01599967a59a4fd36a4350ad4092f3c02232158ca67913ee71d9e
#   rubert_vocab.txt  sha256 f056a69b097422652053bf87565c35543e5d81540ca4b7dddd28de4157a969e0
# api_id/api_hash injected at build time from CI secrets (TG_API_ID/TG_API_HASH); not in this patch.
#
